# Docs theme #docs-theme

Use `theme: docs` or `layout: docs` for a documentation shell generated from headings.

## Authoring model #authoring-model

The same source remains a normal NODX document. The renderer decides whether to emit a single reading column or a documentation shell.

### Heading-driven navigation #heading-driven-navigation

Second-level headings are primary navigation entries. Deeper headings appear in the section outline.

## Renderer contract #renderer-contract

The complete HTML renderer emits the structural shell. Hosts that preview fragments must either call the complete renderer or reproduce the same shell contract.

### Export behavior #export-behavior

Exported HTML should keep the documentation shell when `layout: docs` is present.
